&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A diferencia de Doolittle, la convención del método de Crout establece que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es una matriz triangular inferior general y &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es una matriz triangular superior unitaria (con unos en toda su diagonal principal, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;u&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = 1). De este modo, el sistema &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;LUx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; se divide en dos sistemas triangulares consecutivos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
